    "name": "ZaZa Service - Complete API Collection",
    "description": "150+ API endpoints for ZaZa Food Delivery Ecosystem\n\nThis collection includes:\n- Customer APIs (35+ endpoints)\n- Driver/Delivery Man APIs (30+ endpoints)\n- Vendor/Restaurant APIs (40+ endpoints)\n- Public Catalog APIs (20+ endpoints)\n- Configuration & Utilities (8+ endpoints)\n- Authentication flows for all user types\n\nBase URLs:\n- Development: http://localhost:8000/api/v1\n- Production: https://api.zaza.tj/api/v1\n\nAuthentication:\n- Customers & Vendors: Bearer Token (OAuth)\n- Drivers: Query Parameter Token\n- Public: No authentication required",
